  "body": "### Summary\n#427 and #593 bring back category filters (Tous / Favoris / Suivis / Lus) and the Favoris → category link with its filter. The analysis on #593 found that these filtered list states are not captured. Capture them so nothing is guessed.\n\n### Captures, logged in, in priority order\n1. `forum1.php?cat=<id>&owntopic=1` and `&owntopic=3` for one category, each with at least one row.\n2. Page 2 of one filtered list.\n3. A filtered sub-forum (`subcat` + `owntopic`).\n4. Optional, only if the unread filter (#593) is kept: the REST `read` bucket of one category.\n\nAlso note what `forum1f.php?owntopic=0|2` returns.\n\nAnonymize per FIXTURES.md, and record the facts in HFR-PROTOCOL §6c.\n\n### Wanted by\n#427, #593.",
